OL,3,GNEWSARugby clubhouse more inclusive
OL,4,Aafter expansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rugby club has become more "inclusive
OL,7,Fand can reach even more people"
OL,8,Ffollowing a major expansion project,
OL,9,Fthe council has said.
OL,11,FKingsbridge Rugby Club in Devon has
OL,12,Fextended its clubhouse and created new
OL,13,Fchanging room facilities to enable
OL,14,Fmen's, women's and youth games to all
OL,15,Frun at once for the first time.
OL,17,FThe project was supported by South Hams
OL,18,FDistrict Council, which pledged
OL,19,F#75,000, with further funding coming
OL,20,Ffrom a private fundraiser and #200,000
OL,21,Ffrom the Rugby Football Union (RFU).
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
