OL,3,GNEWSARugby clubhouse more inclusive
OL,4,Aafter expansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FIan Brooking, chairman of Kingsbridge
OL,7,FRFC said it was a "landmark project"
OL,8,Fand "the new changing rooms and
OL,9,Fincreased social space will help
OL,10,Ffacilitate the continued growth of the
OL,11,Fclub".
